{"id":"wb-7-1747","name":"安徽省博物馆陈列展览大楼","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"安徽博物院","text":"安徽博物院又名安徽省博物馆，是中华人民共和国安徽省唯一一家集自然、历史、社教为一体的省级综合类博物馆，庐阳馆（旧馆，1956年建，全国重点文物保护单位名称“安徽省博物馆陈列展览大楼”）位于合肥市庐阳区安庆路268号，占地面积约70亩，蜀山馆（新馆）位于合肥市蜀山区怀宁路268号，建筑面积4.1万平方米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%89%E5%BE%BD%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%99%A2","revisionId":94169549,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94169549","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/6339f7a0b01d95e7552f4b38.jpg","title":"安徽博物院正面.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%AE%89%E5%BE%BD%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%99%A2%E6%AD%A3%E9%9D%A2.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/ca/%E5%AE%89%E5%BE%BD%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%99%A2%E6%AD%A3%E9%9D%A2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"白色瑰宝","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​安徽博物院正面","width":320,"height":188}}